<title>USA: MFRI completes $15-million financing pact.</title>
<headline>MFRI completes $15-million financing pact.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ill. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>MFRI Inc said Wednesday it completed an agreement with an unidentified insurance company for a total of $15 million of fixed-rate financing for 10 years at an interest of 7.21 percent.</p>
<p>The new financing agreement requires payments of only interest during the first four years, MFRI said. The company plans to begin paying level principal payments during the fifth year, giving the loan an average outstanding life of seven years.</p>
<p>MFRI makes custom-designed industrial filtration products.</p>
<p>Its shares were unchanged Wednesday at 7-7/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
